Description: light an on-air sign while the webcam is in use
 camera-sign watches the uvcvideo driver's reference count and switches a
 TP-Link Kasa smart plug on while any program has the webcam open, and off a
 few seconds after it closes. Plugged into the switched outlet, a light box
 with an "ON AIR" insert tells the household not to walk in.
 .
 It runs as a systemd user service; see README.Debian for setting it up.
